  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "two-person rivalry",
  "premise": "Two rivals try to stand first at a booth by constantly repositioning a floor arrow that marks the queue. They rotate themselves into an elaborate spiral and discover the booth serves numbered tickets; a quiet third customer with ticket one gets served while they untangle the arrow.",
